#
# File: 910-mDNS-udp-sport5353-in-reply-DROP.rule
# Title: Allow remote mDNS server multicast reply to local mDNS client
# Description:
#    Drop IPv4 mDNS multicast traffic to 224.0.0.251:5353

ip saddr 224.0.0.251 udp sport 5353 counter drop comment "remote-to-local mDNS/UDP/5353 multicast reply"
